No: the samples were drawn in lesson 09 with fixed seeds, and Closure only \
reads them. Reproducible random points make every card the same from one run \
to the next.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b4acd457-3c26-4445-bbb0-0beb3c3798fd"]
